{"id":2756,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><div><p>为引导学生科学合理规划学业与职业发展，提升就业竞争力，以择业新观念打开就业新天地，进而促进高质量充分就业，1月6日上午，中北大学第三届全国大学生职业规划大赛决赛在主楼七层西厅举办，我院学子赵子豪成功入围就业赛道决赛并夺得研究生组第一名，其指导教师赵笑蕾获得优秀指导教师。</p><p>大赛现场，赵子豪同学将个人经历与专业理论知识系统结合，对岗位需求、岗位胜任力与发展潜力进行了深入分析与科学研判，呈现出一份路径清晰、契合实际的职业规划方案。其答辩陈述不仅展现了扎实的专业素养和清晰的职业认知，更体现出我院学子将个人发展融入国家需要、以所学所长服务社会发展的价值追求，获得了评审专家的一致肯定。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=gLmTLfnRVVU467UM4AkUNQRozlaLRCoiUzUYM8-8nz-iozl0gihFp2hmCIa0U1h2LYyiMkyYLmQ2MN-ZM4-anmNZnl-YozUbUmLinz-YU4TFoRUZL7V2oRTFMzN4LlUJqjfTQ4Oeo4xxC5WZq5MxgDTJQty0LzGaL1yDLmUigtA8pUucc&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6245&e=.jpeg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/BF354226F6B8720F98EB2949B35E22C9/8480AF89/5931D\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 281px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=go7LLaLzUZnlUYLMRC8LlnVnRvsLmWo7nmGDUmTRnll4L8U0gihFp2hmCIa0MkhkM1h7nSyYnlWVUzvPLN-aMz7PU4CYLR7PMNnfMm6VUm6FozUsUmlDnzrFMz7YnmLigtXaQIveo4OepIVY_2T4pShXptQ0g47aLR-0Mm-8MSbw62u8c&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6245&e=.jpeg\"></p><p>根据赛事安排，赵子豪同学将代表学校参加山西省第三届全国大学生职业规划大赛，此次入围省赛，实现了我院在该项赛事中新的突破，标志着我院职业生涯教育与就业指导工作取得了阶段性重要进展。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=gU4VLfL77aLRVfUMNC4nRW2U46fM4UoPMz9aM4n2LN7DM470gihFp2hmCIa0nkybnShfU1ybUz9iU4U4Lz-inRNsLzlsU4r7L8MkLm-4MRWFnmMkU8QfU8rFLz74M4GJv2bjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CYMRlJqdunx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6245&e=.png\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/D9EAB9A85C43125D97157C5D3CB22342/F3BCFACE/11370\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 225px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=gU4VLfL77aLRVfUMNC4nRW2U46fM4UoPMz9aM4n2LN7DM470gihFp2hmCIa0nkybnShfU1ybUz9iU4U4Lz-inRNsLzlsU4r7L8MkLm-4MRWFnmMkU8QfU8rFLz74M4GJv2bjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CYMRlJqdunx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6245&e=.png\"></p><p>下一步，学院将坚持“以赛促学、以赛促教、以赛促就”的工作理念，持续完善“三全育人”格局下的职业生涯教育体系。通过深化课程建设、加强师资协同、拓展实践平台，助力更多学子在实现民族复兴的伟大实践中找准人生定位，书写无愧于时代的青春篇章！</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=goR7LsnR7aMRr7MMNrfLNL8LlMRL4loaM4NiMzQ7Lmn7L7-0gihFp2hmCIa0M1ybn1hRnky4MzMfLmTfUmGbnNQfUlUsnlr7L7LPMlQ2UmnFMm7YoRU8LRVFMNrfoRUJqjfTQ4Oeo4xxC5WZq5MxgDTJQty0LzGaL1yDLmUigtA8pUucc&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6245&e=.jpeg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/69FCD353A29AB09FFAAD7EED0C15FFB4/61284401/6EA84\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 281px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=goRULiL874UmvsnMR94LzUinRVkU4loPLllZM4Q2MNCPUN70gihFp2hmCIa0nSyYM1hkMkysMRfVM4GbUm9PnmT2Um-ZUNWRoRVVLzNiMRWFnmlbnlUDLRnFL4NYU494gtXaQIveo4OepIVY_2T4pShXptQ0g47aLR-0Mm-8MSbw62u8c&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6245&e=.jpeg\"></p></div></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://mkszyxy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=gLmTLfnRVVU467UM4AkUNQRozlaLRCoiUzUYM8-8nz-iozl0gihFp2hmCIa0U1h2LYyiMkyYLmQ2MN-ZM4-anmNZnl-YozUbUmLinz-YU4TFoRUZL7V2oRTFMzN4LlUJqjfTQ4Oeo4xxC5WZq5MxgDTJQty0LzGaL1yDLmUigtA8pUucc&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6245&e=.jpeg"}